          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "過了這山道,就到我們位在北森林的城鎮了。你們可以先在那裡休息一下.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 1,
              "speaker_name": "哈諾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-1",
          "text": "瞧,前面有人呢!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/3b87cf227f66/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "米亞斯多德求救"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "咦?又是一大群獸人,還有.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "哎呀,有救了有救了!救命啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "你為什麼會被獸人追殺呢?我好想知道,趕快告訴我!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "如果你能打敗這些獸人救我一命,我不但告訴你為什麼,還可以額外告訴你一個大秘密!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "呀!聽起來很有趣,我答應.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "喂!不要給大夥兒找麻煩.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "沒關係,反正我們急著要過這山道,順便擺平這些獸人也沒什麼不好。索爾,我說的沒錯吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "亞雷斯,你越來越瞭解我了,不過何必這麼囉唆─咱們說上就上!殺啊!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "這小子真是.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/3b87cf227f66/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "擊退獸人,救下米亞斯多德"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "獸人"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/3b87cf227f66/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "text": "可惡..但是還沒有結束.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "..我不甘心..寶石的秘密.....啊.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/3b87cf227f66/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "米亞斯多德的秘密:獸人大軍將襲精靈城"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "我叫做米亞斯多德。感謝各位的幫忙,我才能撿回一命。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "米亞..好囉唆的名字,你不是說,救了你你就會告訴我們什麼大秘密嗎?快說吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "嘿,其實這個秘密你們不一定會有興趣,不過我還是說出來好了。昨天夜裡我偷聽到獸人部隊的談話,牠們要進攻精靈城鎮哈斯米爾.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "什麼!那不是我們的故鄉嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "糟了,我們要趕快回去警告鎮民們才行!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 11,
              "speaker_name": "索菲亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-11",
          "text": "哈斯米爾不是位在北森林的精靈都城嗎?這可奇怪了,獸人族什麼時候有膽量攻打精靈族了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "但我確實看到相當龐大的獸人部隊集結,牠們總該不是在大露營吧?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "這不重要,我們趕快前往哈斯米爾,幫精靈族打退獸人大軍。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "不好意思,這回又要麻煩你們了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "既然是朋友的事,我們怎能袖手旁觀呢!我們快上路吧,要不然就真的來不及了!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/3b87cf227f66/scenes/3"
    }
